  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">You are trained in the art of using specific weapons, and your body is a deadly weapon. The damage die for your fist increases to 1d6 instead of 1d4. You don’t take the normal -2 circumstance penalty when making a lethal attack with your fist or any other unarmed attacks.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">When you roll initiative, you can enter a Stance. In addition, you gain the @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.4uzuNijCDAYXuD3g]{Monastic Weaponry (Ardorean)} feat.</p>"
    },
